#: ../../source/use-cases/library-data-india.md:1
msgid "Library data (India)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/library-data-india.md:3
msgid ""
"The Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) Delhi used ODE to check errors "
"in large spreadsheets of publications catalogue and educate colleagues "
"about data quality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/library-data-india.md:5
msgid ""
"ODE automatically flagged a range of issues in complex datasets, "
"including bibliographic information from major indexes like Scopus and "
"Web of Science. By identifying formatting inconsistencies, ODE provided a"
" foundation for the team to clean and standardise fields, creating more "
"reliable datasets for their reports and website."
msgstr ""

